## Overview

From Sihlsee in Einsiedeln, the route takes you past a few alpine pastures up to the Spitalgipfel.
You’re treated to a lovely view of the Swiss Alps, the Grosser and Kleiner Mythen to the west and, of course, Sihlsee behind you.
A lovely walk, though one that should really be undertaken in May at the earliest. March was definitely too early, and there was still snow up to knee-depth in places – not just on the north-facing slopes.

## How to get there

Travel to Einsiedeln. Then take bus route 555 for 10 minutes to Gross, Ebenau.
<JourneyPlanner from="<current location>" to="Gross, Ebenau" toFixed target="arrival" time="10:00" />

## First ascent

From Gross, we set off straight away with the first proper climb. A good warm-up for the rest of the hike.
<HikeImage idx={0} />
<HikeImage idx={1} />
<HikeImage idx={2} />

Early in the year, you can see beautiful alpine pastures, albeit with a little too much snow for some people’s liking.
<HikeImage idx={3} />
<HikeImage idx={4} />

### First hill

The first hill has been climbed. The route now runs fairly flat for two kilometres along the alpine pastures.
Meanwhile, you have a wonderful view of the Swiss Alps and Lake Sihl.


## Second hill
Now the route takes you through a wood to the second hill, the Spital. The trees get in the way here and there, but it’s not a major scramble to get to the top.
<HikeImage idx={5} />
<HikeImage idx={6} />
<HikeImage idx={7} />
<HikeImage idx={8} />
<HikeImage idx={9} />
<HikeImage idx={10} />
<HikeImage idx={11} />
<HikeImage idx={12} />
<HikeImage idx={13} />
<HikeImage idx={14} />
<HikeImage idx={15} />
<HikeImage idx={16} />

Now for the worst section, at least if you’re out and about too early in the year: the final hill up to Spital is still covered in snow well into the year, and anyone who isn’t there very early in the morning risks sinking into the snow time and again.

<HikeImage idx={17} />
<HikeImage idx={18} />

## Spital

Once you arrive at Spital, it’s worth taking a break to enjoy the view.
<HikeImage idx={19} />
<HikeImage idx={20} />
<HikeImage idx={21} />
<HikeImage idx={22} />

## Descent
The descent to Unteriberg is quite quick, but the route is not snow-free until May.

<HikeImage idx={23} />
<HikeImage idx={24} />

## Journey home

Arrived in Unteriberg — time for a break before the return journey.

<HikeImage idx={25} />

From Unteriberg, take the bus back to Einsiedeln (line 555 or 556) and continue by
S-Bahn from Einsiedeln.
<JourneyPlanner from="Unteriberg, Guggelstrasse" to="<current location>" fromFixed target=departure time="14:30" />
